    "name": "Minigame Madness",
    "steam_appid": 1408080,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>IMPORTANT</h1><p><strong>\u26a0\ufe0f</strong> Playercounts currently fluctuate. <strong>Bring a friend for the best experience!</strong><br><strong>\u26a0\ufe0f</strong> <strong>Try before you buy!</strong> All progress in <i>Lite</i> is carried over when you upgrade.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408080/extras/593c66d50e8f3d6bc3fc125d26b0cbbd.webp?t=1753655858\" /></div></p><br><h1>15 MINIGAMES</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408080/extras/467ea13b7c318e2ab154b8c2d5587f37.avif?t=1753655858\" /></div><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408080/extras/df3277fed14a9478077d0387cb3d1e1a.avif?t=1753655858\" /></div><br><strong>Minigame Madness</strong> is a high-difficulty multiplayer party game for 1-16 players online. Compete with friends or strangers in an ever-growing collection of frantic minigames to unlock shiny badges, design stylish outfits &amp; create awesome condos!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Massive, ever-growing collection of exciting free-for-all minigames!<br></li><li>\ud83c\udfa8 Character customization with unlockable skins, clothes, accessories and more!<br></li><li>\ud83c\udfc6 Daily challenges, global leaderboards, achievements, ranks and badges!<br></li><li>\ud83d\udcca Detailed gameplay statistics to track and compare with friends!<br></li><li>\ud83d\udd12 Private server hosting with personalized minigame playlists!<br></li><li>\ud83c\udfe0 Creative physics-sandbox player-housing with YouTube-integration!<br></li><li>\ud83d\ude80 Tiny download, quick startup, frequent updates, and <i>Lite</i> is free \u2014 jump right in!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408080/extras/010b2b96805a2517051b4a2abec4e54f.webp?t=1753655858\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408080/extras/d271a4ac8498bb4ca6e5bd9cf882db39.poster.avif?t=1753655858\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408080/extras/d271a4ac8498bb4ca6e5bd9cf882db39.webm?t=1753655858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408080/extras/d271a4ac8498bb4ca6e5bd9cf882db39.mp4?t=1753655858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f THE MINIGAME MEGA-LIST</h2>A massive, ever-growing collection of frantic free-for-all minigames! Knock friends into the abyss in <i>Sumo Shamble</i>, dodge hundreds of giant bullets in <i>Blazing Bullets</i>, and pass the bomb in <i>Explosive Exchange</i>. New minigames of all types and genres will be added regularly!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf08 PLAY HOW YOU WANT</h2>Play minigames back-to-back in <i>Arcade</i>, <span class=\"bb_strike\">be the last one standing in <i>Royale</i>, or join forces with your friends in <i>Teams</i>!</span> Compete with up to 16 players in official servers, or host a private one <span class=\"bb_strike\">with bots</span>! Experience the madness in first- or third-person mode, with keyboard or controller.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfa8 PERSONALIZE YOURSELF</h2>Earn coins by playing minigames, get gems by winning them! Coins can be spent to randomly unbox awesome skins and stylish clothes, while gems can be used to buy the outfit of your dreams! Complete daily challenges to get rich, and buy epic capes, <span class=\"bb_strike\">sparkly effects</span> and more!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfc6 UNLOCK EVERYTHING</h2>Numerous challenging achievements to unlock, shiny badges to earn, impressive ranks to gain and cool statistics to showcase on your customizable player profile. Compare with friends to see who's the best, and check your position daily on the many global leaderboards!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408080/extras/7dbf68fb47ae5db065679ad0081e8a3e.poster.avif?t=1753655858\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408080/extras/7dbf68fb47ae5db065679ad0081e8a3e.webm?t=1753655858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408080/extras/7dbf68fb47ae5db065679ad0081e8a3e.mp4?t=1753655858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfaf PICK THE MINIGAMES</h2>Choose the minigames you want to play by voting on random options before each round starts! For more control, you can spend gems to force any minigame from our collection, or even create a personalized playlist for your private server!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfe0 BUILD YOUR CONDO</h2>Unwind with friends in your <i>Condo</i> after intense minigame sessions! Use your hard-earned winnings to create epic mansions, impressive museums, thrilling theme parks, Youtube-theaters, and even custom minigames \u2014 all within a creative physics-sandbox environment.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf1f OUR FOREVER-GAME</h2>We plan to continue expanding Minigame Madness in content and features indefinitely. Given enough demand we have some crazy ideas like: 16+ player support, modes like <i>Ranked</i> with skill-based matchmaking, reaching 100+ minigames, and so forth!<br><br><strong>The growing scope may cause the price to increase in the future, but once purchased you will always have access to Minigame Madness. Excited to have you along for the ride!</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1408080/extras/010b2b96805a2517051b4a2abec4e54f.webp?t=1753655858\" /></div><br><i>Need more madness? Check out these awesome games we're often compared to:<br>Fall Guys, Stumble Guys, Crab Game, Roblox, Minecraft (Hypixel), Hytale, Pummel Party, Wobbly Life, Tower Unite, s&amp;box &amp; Garry's Mod.</i>",
